  "abstract": "This submission introduces a novel initial configuration for the 26 circle centers using a spiral pattern. One circle is placed at the center of the unit square, and the remaining 25 are arranged outwards in a linear spiral, spanning approximately three turns. This structured starting point is then refined using a local search optimization (2000 steps, 0.01 perturbation strength) combined with the robust `compute_max_radii` function (50 iterations, 1e-7 safety margin) to maximize the sum of radii while ensuring no overlaps.",
